#: tools/mrr-growth-calculator.html
msgid "<0>CMGR</0> = (Ending MRR ÷ Starting MRR)^(1 ÷ months) − 1"
msgstr "<0>CMGR</0> = (MRR Final ÷ MRR Inicial)^(1 ÷ meses) − 1"

#: tools/mrr-growth-calculator.html
msgid "<0>Net MRR Growth Rate</0> = (Ending MRR − Starting MRR) ÷ Starting MRR"
msgstr ""
"<0>Taxa de Crescimento Líquido do MRR</0> = (MRR Final − MRR Inicial) ÷ MRR Inicial"

#: tools/mrr-growth-calculator.html
msgid "<0>Required CMGR</0> = (Target MRR ÷ Ending MRR)^(1 ÷ months) − 1"
msgstr "<0>CMGR Necessário</0> = (MRR Alvo ÷ MRR Final)^(1 ÷ meses) − 1"

#: tools/mrr-growth-calculator.html
msgid ""
"CMGR (Compound Monthly Growth Rate) is the average monthly growth needed to move from your starting MRR to ending MRR over a number of months. It normalizes growth velocity, so teams can compare periods of different length."
msgstr ""
"CMGR (Taxa de Crescimento Mensal Composta) é o crescimento mensal médio necessário para passar do seu MRR inicial para o MRR final ao longo de um número de meses. Ele normaliza a velocidade de crescimento, para que as equipes possam comparar períodos de diferentes durações."

#: tools/mrr-growth-calculator.html
msgid ""
"CMGR tells you momentum. It doesn't tell you what changed underneath the slope."
msgstr "O CMGR diz o seu momentum. Ele não diz o que mudou sob a inclinação."

#. meta og:description
#: tools/mrr-growth-calculator.html
msgid ""
"Calculate MRR growth rate, compound monthly growth, and target growth requirements instantly."
msgstr ""
"Calcule a taxa de crescimento do MRR, o crescimento mensal composto e os requisitos de crescimento alvo instantaneamente."

#: tools/mrr-growth-calculator.html
msgid "Calculate growth →"
msgstr "Calcular crescimento →"

#: tools/mrr-growth-calculator.html
msgid "Can this calculator show MRR contraction?"
msgstr "Esta calculadora pode mostrar contração do MRR?"

#: tools/mrr-growth-calculator.html
msgid ""
"Duct automates this across your stack so growth leaders see weekly trajectory shifts instead of discovering them at quarter close."
msgstr ""
"Duct automatiza isso em toda a sua stack para que os líderes de crescimento vejam as mudanças de trajetória semanais em vez de descobri-las no fechamento do trimestre."

#: tools/mrr-growth-calculator.html
msgid ""
